<!--
  UIDemo's C# sign (examples/UIDemo/README.md, "The C# variant"): loaded by scripts/SignSetup.cs into a world root the
  script makes on a small quad beside the name plate, and styled by world.css. The script aims a ray at it from the
  window's camera through the cursor each frame; its button's click is logged from C#.
-->
<panel id="sign">
    <label class="sign-title">Made in C#</label>
    <button id="sign-button">Press</button>
</panel>
